'''Plaguebringer''' is a Notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Necromancer]] that grants the you and your minions increased [[area of effect]] if you've consumed a corpse in the past 4 seconds. In addition, while near a corpse, you and nearby allies gain more damage while nearby enemies deal reduced damage.

The more damage and enemies deal reduced damage buff is coded as auras. The player character, the allies and the enemies would have visual aura effects on them. 

==Ruthless mode==
